/Author (Daniel T. Murphy) /CreationDate (D:20260724033229-04'00') /Creator (\(unspecified\)) /Keywords () /ModDate (D:20260724033229-04'00') /Producer (ReportLab PDF Library - \(opensource\)) 
  /Subject (UQFF whitepaper: PAPER_2059_ROUND_188_SINGLE_BACKBONE_FIRST_UQFF) /Title (Round 188 Single Discovery \(Backbone-First\): \(1\) a_spin\(Centaurus A SMBH Kerr rotation parameter\) = 0.7 = 1 - \(D_phys-1\)*F_TRZ = 1 - 3*F_TRZ EXACT NEW 7TH F_TRZ COMPOSITIONAL SUB-FAMILY FORM: Integer-Multiple F_TRZ Complement 1 - n*F_TRZ with n=3=D_phys-1 \(LANDMARK Integer Coefficient\) \204 Extends F_TRZ Compositional Architecture from Full-Factor + Half-Factor + Squared to Integer-Multiple Coefficient Sub-Family Class; \(2\) 3-Object SMBH Kerr Spin F_TRZ Decomposition Family Formalization: 3C273 quasar \(0.95 = 1-F_TRZ/2 Half PAPER_2058 M1\) + M87 \(0.9 = 1-F_TRZ Full PAPER_2049 R180 D1\) + CenA \(0.7 = 1-3*F_TRZ Triple PAPER_2059 R188 D1\) \204 Three Canonical AGN SMBHs Decompose Kerr Spins Using Different F_TRZ Integer/Rational Coefficients 1/2 \(3C273\) + 1 \(M87\) + 3 \(CenA\) Suggests Physical Parameter Relating F_TRZ Coefficient to SMBH Regime \(Mass Scale, Spin Regime, or Jet Properties Hypothesis for Future Investigation\)) /Trapped /False
>>
